[
  {
    "id": "6930-75918-0000",
    "path": "audio/6930-75918-0000.mp3",
    "reference": "concord returned to its place amidst the tents",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "5c5b0959d89e6464885e9b144a5ef028f76629d0f93488b832214c4cc301731c"
  },
  {
    "id": "6930-75918-0002",
    "path": "audio/6930-75918-0002.mp3",
    "reference": "congratulations were poured in upon the princess everywhere during her journey",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "44b7130da9b3c2f0f44c07cb0c50f78dfba1b58828923b3767a6491bf1552d06"
  },
  {
    "id": "1320-122617-0000",
    "path": "audio/1320-122617-0000.mp3",
    "reference": "notwithstanding the high resolution of hawkeye he fully comprehended all the difficulties and danger he was about to incur",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "1a6dc94c4934329e1322086c0b7065720fe8d6537bd531a9895e2840f623c690"
  },
  {
    "id": "1320-122617-0003",
    "path": "audio/1320-122617-0003.mp3",
    "reference": "there was something in his air and manner that betrayed to the scout the utter confusion of the state of his mind",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "ee4010d352bbec0daead619d5aaf140c5750424557373a916b3ec10f703276ba"
  },
  {
    "id": "5639-40744-0005",
    "path": "audio/5639-40744-0005.mp3",
    "reference": "finally the one party went off exulting and the other was left in desolation and woe",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "1ab3f7cbc77a7c8e62302ae3af4b52ce29e9a84a485f7b028f65067cd55b3c28"
  },
  {
    "id": "5639-40744-0007",
    "path": "audio/5639-40744-0007.mp3",
    "reference": "meanwhile rodolfo had leocadia safe in his custody and in his own apartment",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "8467cfb52967c3b31f62108efb4fbabf262dee43a257206804715ba924aefff6"
  },
  {
    "id": "260-123440-0000",
    "path": "audio/260-123440-0000.mp3",
    "reference": "and how odd the directions will look",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "61e6cd9c4e0841ade81f0855a87017e2300fc08356d84d70ebc8096d89c48e0c"
  },
  {
    "id": "260-123440-0001",
    "path": "audio/260-123440-0001.mp3",
    "reference": "poor alice",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "cce2b7835bf0a0ef63675996bb803e4083b5defcee74b1252a2e85f8e7e31034"
  },
  {
    "id": "7729-102255-0000",
    "path": "audio/7729-102255-0000.mp3",
    "reference": "the bogus legislature numbered thirty six members",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "73d13d314b8ea553adfc3c90206d41fc911ed336c12e085816cb05a2d12f9f1d"
  },
  {
    "id": "7729-102255-0001",
    "path": "audio/7729-102255-0001.mp3",
    "reference": "this was at the march election eighteen fifty five",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "05bbc655a8d019fdb817231775a537b0f323ee69e7f55a32816bdaf086abd4d9"
  },
  {
    "id": "2094-142345-0004",
    "path": "audio/2094-142345-0004.mp3",
    "reference": "and what through the left hand window",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "2a58de8665fde0e76af0cd6bdc3ccb08803a3f0ea8c6f034e55202782060d91e"
  },
  {
    "id": "2094-142345-0007",
    "path": "audio/2094-142345-0007.mp3",
    "reference": "the history of the house is plain now",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "4c9a947173d4fd1bf6f3d98d127d9fb1a9661b6e12ee59a5b0d607bae85a9be2"
  },
  {
    "id": "3575-170457-0001",
    "path": "audio/3575-170457-0001.mp3",
    "reference": "why are we to be denied each other's society",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "f9e14a8bd585068e2c496327587f7780d6acacca815b46a4df5a96723b828ebb"
  },
  {
    "id": "3575-170457-0002",
    "path": "audio/3575-170457-0002.mp3",
    "reference": "why are we to be divided",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "7e03e9ff43b4ce00d8e98da3b8835217ca14b2c1b7436690478fd4680a1acc1d"
  },
  {
    "id": "7127-75947-0001",
    "path": "audio/7127-75947-0001.mp3",
    "reference": "upon this madame deigned to turn her eyes languishingly towards the comte observing",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "b4124f6ca767125cdd9ee8f23a1a005b331c1e38f68cf37cae355551285b80d3"
  },
  {
    "id": "7127-75947-0002",
    "path": "audio/7127-75947-0002.mp3",
    "reference": "do you think so she replied with indifference",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "e1a8850e565e0e807679a9046d05ab782001b85ec250891ae18b938e1e00042b"
  },
  {
    "id": "2961-960-0007",
    "path": "audio/2961-960-0007.mp3",
    "reference": "but they have nothing to do with the interpretation of plato and in spirit they are opposed to him",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "603fd76cf0aa5e7034feaa7b40569803c29ca411be52966d1962fc68fd0d0fac"
  },
  {
    "id": "2961-960-0012",
    "path": "audio/2961-960-0012.mp3",
    "reference": "many if not all the elements of the pre socratic philosophy are included in the timaeus",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "4880b340ed8d5f1d5117e2c0793eefa921bf186804dfb5082c044d940aeaf592"
  },
  {
    "id": "8463-287645-0000",
    "path": "audio/8463-287645-0000.mp3",
    "reference": "this was what did the mischief so far as the running away was concerned",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "8787cab307d2c061f5e5340c22001b7a086f907b71ea885d73b9f991c7635e5d"
  },
  {
    "id": "8463-287645-0001",
    "path": "audio/8463-287645-0001.mp3",
    "reference": "it is hardly necessary to say more of them here",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "429630099b3dfe81836254eff524f10d0c519922407ca95681930b4119e8a4ee"
  },
  {
    "id": "8230-279154-0003",
    "path": "audio/8230-279154-0003.mp3",
    "reference": "and what sort of evidence is logically possible",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "cfdeb630366549e74cb1d0a7ef8d21d09283871abaa49998628398dc6a52f75c"
  },
  {
    "id": "8230-279154-0005",
    "path": "audio/8230-279154-0005.mp3",
    "reference": "all that i am doing is to use its logical tenability as a help in the analysis of what occurs when we remember",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "ae7d43c76c696416e97379145d35d84c3958bc1eeca649997ad77359050e9053"
  },
  {
    "id": "7176-92135-0001",
    "path": "audio/7176-92135-0001.mp3",
    "reference": "in short he becomes a prominent figure in london society and if he is not careful somebody will say so",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "179a46d543c221f83d67b0b79f69fc4e5267fe8ff1767b164d5398b911628311"
  },
  {
    "id": "7176-92135-0002",
    "path": "audio/7176-92135-0002.mp3",
    "reference": "but even the unsuccessful dramatist has his moments",
    "category": "human",
    "sha256": "9424bce609426743c535b042f7c6360c62ba6dc19a119f58cd834da94ccb8f51"
  },
